{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Mem</b> of משד, like the <b>mem</b> of מחמס אחיך יעקב." "<b>עתה אקום יאמר ה'</b> — by way of prophecy." "<b>אשית בישע</b> — like: לכו לחמו בלחמי ושתו ביין מסכתי." "And the meaning of <b>אשית ישע אשר יפיח לו</b> — he will speak, like: יפיח כזבים, and it is joined with the verse that comes after it."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {0 "The verse reference for מחמס אחיך יעקב is Obadiah 1:10; Ibn Ezra cites only the phrase.", 2 "The comparison verse is Proverbs 9:5; the bet of בישע parallels the bet-prefix on the nouns in that verse."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:11.285092191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}